   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Unambiguous identification of the referent",
     "texto": [
      "When several nouns with different genders coexist in a main clause (*der Gutachter*, *die Akte*, *das Protokoll*), the relative pronoun indicates precisely which of them the subordinate clarification refers to:"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Main noun",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Gender",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Relative in the subordinate clause",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example sentence",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "der Sachverständige",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Masculine",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "dem die Richterin vertraut",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Das ist der Sachverständige, dem die Richterin vertraut.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "die Akte",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Feminine",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "in der wichtige Daten fehlen",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Er prüfte die Akte, in der wichtige Daten fehlen.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "das Gutachten",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Neuter",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "das neue Indizien aufdeckt",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Sie las das Gutachten, das neue Indizien aufdeckt.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "die Zeugenaussagen",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Plural",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "auf die sich die Klage stützt",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Das sind Aussagen, auf die sich die Klage stützt.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Ambiguity avoided",
     "texto": [
      "In Spanish, phrases like \"the report of the commission that was approved yesterday\" raise doubts about whether the report or the commission was approved. In German, the explicit gender agreement of the relative (**das** for *das Gutachten*, **die** for *die Kommission*) eliminates any interpretive ambiguity at the root."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
